    "id": "F24/introduction-to-aws-part-1",
    "title": "Introduction to AWS - Part 1",
    "semester": "Fall 2024",
    "summary": "Students will learn about AWS, a cloud computing service provided by Amazon and learn about its use case, and its importance in the current Software Engineering field. They will also learn about other AWS services like S3 Buckets, SQS, SNS, and Lambda functions. This will be the first part of a 2 part series.",
    "date_label": "Wednesday, November 13th 2024",
    "time_label": "1:40 PM - 2:55 PM",
    "location": "1.114 - New Building",
