    "title": "Hands on with AWS - Part 2",
    "semester": "Fall 2024",
    "summary": "Students will learn how to implement AWS services like S3 Buckets, SQS, Lambda Functions, SNS, and possibly a PostgresQL database with Python, which is a high-level programming language (or React) This will be the second part of a 2 part series.",
